#question(title: [A sneaky function])[
  Construct a function $f$ satisfying all the
  following properties:

  - Domain $display(f = RR)$
  - $f$ is continuous
  - $f' (0) = 0$
  - $f$ does not have a local extremum at
    $0$.
  - There isn't an interval centered at $0$
    on which $f$ is increasing.
  - There isn't an interval centered at $0$
    on which $f$ is decreasing.
]
